OL,3,GNEWSABeekeepers fear being stung in
OL,4,Atrademark row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA company seeking to secure its name as
OL,7,Fa trademark is creating a buzz among
OL,8,Fbeekeepers in Yorkshire who worry they
OL,9,Fmay lose the right to describe
OL,10,Fthemselves as running services in the
OL,11,Fregion.
OL,13,FSettle-based The Yorkshire Beekeeper
OL,14,Fhas asked the Intellectual Property
OL,15,FOffice (IPO) for exclusive rights to
OL,16,Fthe name, which would prevent others
OL,17,Fusing it on labelling.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
