OL,3,GNEWSABeekeepers fear being stung in
OL,4,Atrademark row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Yorkshire Beekeepers Association,
OL,7,Fwhich represents about 2,000 people,
OL,8,Fhas launched a petition against the
OL,9,Fmove, while the British Beekeepers
OL,10,FAssociation is also opposed.
OL,12,FThe Yorkshire Beekeeper founder Matthew
OL,13,FBravery said he could not comment on
OL,14,Fthe ongoing application, while the IPO
OL,15,Fsaid it was "unable to speculate on
OL,16,Fnext steps".
